264
00:17:28,700 --> 00:17:29,582
He's been shot!

265
00:17:30,460 --> 00:17:33,320
Time to put out the fire. Ready? Yeah!

266
00:17:33,880 --> 00:17:35,840
I'm sorry. Thank you.

267
00:17:36,320 --> 00:17:37,600
You saved me.

268
00:17:37,940 --> 00:17:40,360
I was about to kill my own family.

269
00:17:40,720 --> 00:17:42,580
I set the town on fire.

270
00:17:42,900 --> 00:17:43,980
I'm sorry.

271
00:17:44,280 --> 00:17:47,780
I cut up my own best friend. So did I.

272
00:17:48,000 --> 00:17:49,100
It was awful.

273
00:17:49,500 --> 00:17:51,140
Nobody blames you for this.

274
00:17:51,360 --> 00:17:52,320
You're a victim.

275
00:17:52,500 --> 00:17:54,735
We all know this is Doflamingo's work.

276
00:17:55,000 --> 00:17:58,059
We gotta bring an end to
this sadistic game somehow.

277
00:17:59,500 --> 00:18:00,330
Hey!

278
00:18:00,413 --> 00:18:02,717
I was looking around and found King Rick!

279
00:18:02,800 --> 00:18:05,800
And he's got that five-star
god Usopp guy with him!

280
00:18:07,000 --> 00:18:08,440
All right, let's do it.

281
00:18:08,820 --> 00:18:10,996
Right, but we're only capturing them.

282
00:18:11,780 --> 00:18:12,610
Understand?

283
00:18:13,400 --> 00:18:14,230
Uh-huh.

284
00:18:14,313 --> 00:18:15,437
There's been enough killing today.

285
00:18:15,520 --> 00:18:16,991
Let's put an end to this.

286
00:18:17,600 --> 00:18:21,700
Move in quick, then take King Rick
and god Usopp as hostages. Yeah!

287
00:18:22,260 --> 00:18:25,697
Then we can use them to lure in
the others with star bounties.

288
00:18:25,780 --> 00:18:26,610
Yeah!

289
00:18:27,680 --> 00:18:29,160
Tell everyone you can!

290
00:18:32,820 --> 00:18:36,480
We'll all come together at
the Old King's Plateau. Yeah!

291
00:18:48,660 --> 00:18:50,620
What are you lazy bugs doing?

292
00:18:52,620 --> 00:18:55,340
Did you idiots knock over this SAD tank?

293
00:18:55,440 --> 00:18:56,897
It's spilling everywhere.

294
00:18:56,980 --> 00:18:58,500
Come on, pick it up.

295
00:18:59,560 --> 00:19:00,620
Are you OK?

296
00:19:00,980 --> 00:19:01,917
It wasn't us.

297
00:19:02,000 --> 00:19:03,797
There was an earthquake out of the blue,

298
00:19:03,880 --> 00:19:06,077
and then before we knew
it, the tank fell flat!

299
00:19:06,160 --> 00:19:06,990
We promise!

300
00:19:07,300 --> 00:19:09,077
Did something cause that earthquake?

301
00:19:09,160 --> 00:19:10,060
Shut your hole!

302
00:19:10,240 --> 00:19:12,097
You don't need to worry about that stuff!

303
00:19:12,180 --> 00:19:13,010
But...

304
00:19:13,093 --> 00:19:13,923
Come on, guys!

305
00:19:14,100 --> 00:19:17,240
You want to cure Princess
Monterey's illness or not?

306
00:19:17,340 --> 00:19:19,040
What if she dies, huh?

307
00:19:19,520 --> 00:19:21,277
Of course we want to save her!

308
00:19:21,360 --> 00:19:22,297
How is she?

309
00:19:22,380 --> 00:19:24,027
We haven't heard in a while!

310
00:19:26,740 --> 00:19:30,257
I'm sorry to say that the princess
isn't getting any better at all!

311
00:19:30,340 --> 00:19:31,260
Not at all!

312
00:19:32,840 --> 00:19:34,940
Let us see the princess just once.

313
00:19:35,200 --> 00:19:36,965
You're such a little nuisance.

314
00:19:38,480 --> 00:19:40,040
Shut up and get to work.

315
00:19:47,100 --> 00:19:49,457
Those smiles aren't
going to make themselves,

316
00:19:49,540 --> 00:19:52,599
so stop gawking or you're
all going to get the whip.

317
00:19:57,040 --> 00:19:58,700
Are you listening to me?

318
00:19:58,880 --> 00:20:01,137
Am I not speaking loud
enough, you dimwits?

319
00:20:01,220 --> 00:20:02,700
Quit zoning out!

320
00:20:02,860 --> 00:20:04,280
What's wrong with you?!

321
00:20:06,400 --> 00:20:08,220
Those letters, they're...

322
00:20:18,140 --> 00:20:19,500
The pink bees!

323
00:20:21,280 --> 00:20:22,110
Beyond!

324
00:20:24,440 --> 00:20:25,860
And now, wake up!

325
00:20:26,380 --> 00:20:27,210
Good!

326
00:20:27,293 --> 00:20:28,372
They noticed us, Beyond!

327
00:20:28,500 --> 00:20:29,337
Roger that!

328
00:20:29,420 --> 00:20:32,020
Okay, team, the next message!

329
00:20:41,420 --> 00:20:43,420
Uh, we got fooled?

330
00:20:44,000 --> 00:20:45,700
I don't understand.

331
00:20:46,080 --> 00:20:49,609
If you won't listen, I'm gonna
make the whip do the talking!

332
00:20:49,740 --> 00:20:51,257
Fooled about the princess?

333
00:20:51,340 --> 00:20:52,840
Fooled about her illness?

334
00:20:54,000 --> 00:20:56,941
Doflamingo has been lying
to keep us trapped here?

335
00:21:01,640 --> 00:21:04,820
All right, I got no choice
but to beat it into you.

336
00:21:05,200 --> 00:21:08,965
I don't know what's going on, but
there's one thing I'm sure of.

337
00:21:10,960 --> 00:21:12,780
My friends wouldn't lie!

338
00:21:15,900 --> 00:21:17,280
Shut up, underlings!

339
00:21:44,080 --> 00:21:45,320
Oh, it's Drawhead!

340
00:21:45,460 --> 00:21:48,342
So Flamingo's up at the
top of this place, right?

341
00:21:49,300 --> 00:21:51,653
Cabbage, you try to get in my way again!

342
00:21:52,080 --> 00:21:53,220
Not this time.

343
00:21:54,600 --> 00:21:55,460
Hop on.

344
00:21:56,300 --> 00:21:59,337
Not my first choice, but I've
decided to give you a ride.

345
00:21:59,420 --> 00:22:00,660
Are you serious?

346
00:22:01,020 --> 00:22:03,617
You need to get to Doflamingo
quickly, don't you?

347
00:22:03,700 --> 00:22:04,530
All right!

348
00:22:04,820 --> 00:22:06,360
Let's get going! Ride!

349
00:22:06,840 --> 00:22:08,337
What a small hint of gratitude!

350
00:22:08,420 --> 00:22:09,250
Kill you!

351
00:22:09,333 --> 00:22:10,537
Just make the horse go!

352
00:22:10,620 --> 00:22:12,091
Don't tell me what to do!

353
00:22:12,180 --> 00:22:13,340
Let's go, Farul.

354
00:22:14,780 --> 00:22:18,604
Listen, if the executives catch
us, we'll be stuck here for ages.

355
00:22:18,700 --> 00:22:20,757
I'll cut through the wall and make a path.

356
00:22:20,840 --> 00:22:22,797
You knock the enemies out of our way.

357
00:22:22,880 --> 00:22:23,710
Got it!

358
00:22:23,793 --> 00:22:26,077
We'll push through to the
third level in one shot.

359
00:22:26,160 --> 00:22:26,990
Hey!

360
00:22:27,073 --> 00:22:28,637
When the hell did we pick
up an extra passenger?

361
00:22:28,720 --> 00:22:29,960
Oh, hey, soldier.

362
00:22:30,240 --> 00:22:31,217
What are you doing on my horse?

363
00:22:31,300 --> 00:22:32,130
Riding.

364
00:22:32,213 --> 00:22:34,457
I followed Luffyland's trail
and it brought me here.

365
00:22:34,540 --> 00:22:37,020
Wait! Get off! Lucky break.

366
00:22:37,300 --> 00:22:38,497
I was looking for you.

367
00:22:38,580 --> 00:22:39,937
I don't care if you're friends.

368
00:22:40,020 --> 00:22:40,961
Four's too many.

369
00:22:41,220 --> 00:22:44,514
We're gonna meet up with
Rebecca after we go up a level.

370
00:22:44,680 --> 00:22:46,257
Rebecca's in enemy territory?

371
00:22:46,340 --> 00:22:47,520
You didn't stop her?

372
00:22:47,760 --> 00:22:48,860
Don't ignore me!

373
00:22:49,220 --> 00:22:52,437
She's headed up to the sunflower
field to deliver a key to me.

374
00:22:52,520 --> 00:22:53,797
But she's on the wanted list.

375
00:22:53,880 --> 00:22:55,377
What if somebody captures her?

376
00:22:55,460 --> 00:22:56,290
Don't worry.

377
00:22:56,373 --> 00:22:57,697
My friends are there to protect her.

378
00:22:57,780 --> 00:22:58,610
Listen!

379
00:22:58,693 --> 00:23:02,797
My elegant steed can't maintain its
elegance with four people on its back!

380
00:23:02,880 --> 00:23:05,351
I was more comfortable riding on the bull.

381
00:23:05,760 --> 00:23:09,407
By the way, Pops, why did you
take off in such a hurry before?

382
00:23:09,520 --> 00:23:11,537
My goal in this is the same as yours.

383
00:23:11,620 --> 00:23:16,680
I must liberate this kingdom and beat
O 'Flamingo as swiftly as possible.

384
00:23:17,660 --> 00:23:19,248
But there's one more thing.

385
00:23:19,360 --> 00:23:21,437
A personal matter that I must settle.

386
00:23:21,520 --> 00:23:24,755
A top executive that I must
kill with my own two hands.

387
00:23:26,060 --> 00:23:30,977
that's fine but don't die trying okay
of course not i won't be defeated

388
00:23:31,060 --> 00:23:36,537
with my true body okay then not okay
get off why don't you get off this

389
00:23:36,620 --> 00:23:40,977
is my horse you're the worst of the
whole worst generation watch where

390
00:23:41,060 --> 00:23:46,160
you're going we're gonna crash look
like i said don't Tell me what to do!

391
00:23:49,540 --> 00:23:50,370
What's that?

392
00:23:52,860 --> 00:23:54,180
We got this.

393
00:23:54,320 --> 00:23:55,260
Go on ahead.

394
00:23:57,200 --> 00:23:59,017
We'll keep them busy, Straw Hat.

395
00:23:59,100 --> 00:23:59,930
Don't worry.

396
00:24:00,013 --> 00:24:00,882
They're a team.

397
00:24:01,220 --> 00:24:02,700
All of a sudden, Ean.

398
00:24:02,860 --> 00:24:05,837
They were one step away from
fighting each other a second ago.

399
00:24:05,920 --> 00:24:06,750
That's cool.

400
00:24:06,833 --> 00:24:08,071
But what's going on here?

401
00:24:08,160 --> 00:24:09,278
You're friends now?

402
00:24:10,620 --> 00:24:12,400
I'm a famous tactician.

403
00:24:12,640 --> 00:24:13,817
And this is war.

404
00:24:13,900 --> 00:24:17,800
I helped them realize we need
each other to grasp victory!

405
00:24:19,620 --> 00:24:22,600
Dagama may be a rat, but
his plan makes sense.

406
00:24:22,840 --> 00:24:25,057
Our best bet is to help Straw Hat win.

407
00:24:25,140 --> 00:24:26,260
So get moving!

408
00:24:26,500 --> 00:24:27,840
You take out the boss.

409
00:24:28,000 --> 00:24:29,920
We'll keep the executives busy.

410
00:24:30,180 --> 00:24:31,651
Get him there, Cavendish.

411
00:24:31,740 --> 00:24:33,740
And make it quick! I see.

412
00:24:33,880 --> 00:24:35,977
So I've been reduced to a chauffeur.

413
00:24:36,060 --> 00:24:38,400
Don't give him an inch! You ready?

414
00:24:47,060 --> 00:24:48,140
Excellent work!

415
00:24:50,560 --> 00:24:53,384
Looks like that stubby
guy is calling the shots.

416
00:24:53,480 --> 00:24:54,760
I'll stomp him out!

417
00:25:06,660 --> 00:25:08,120
Garamon took a big hit!

418
00:25:10,040 --> 00:25:10,870
What?

419
00:25:10,953 --> 00:25:12,640
Hey, let go of me, you jerk!

420
00:25:15,800 --> 00:25:17,840
Keep going, Straw Hats!

421
00:25:18,400 --> 00:25:19,600
Don't look back!

422
00:25:22,900 --> 00:25:24,000
Open fire!

423
00:25:24,540 --> 00:25:26,720
Keep them down there at any cost!

424
00:25:33,820 --> 00:25:36,560
Blade of beauty, sans-t-ex-zu-peri!
